A simple lead management system for small businesses and freelancers to track and manage their sales leads.

What It Does
- LocalLead Mini helps you organize potential customers (leads) and track them through your sales process - from first contact to closing the deal.

Target Users
- Freelancers managing client prospects
- Small business owners (real estate agents, insurance agents, consultants)
- Sales professionals who need simple lead tracking
- Anyone who gets leads from multiple sources and needs to stay organized

Core Features
1. User Authentication

Secure signup and login
Personal lead database (each user sees only their own leads)

2. Lead Management

Add new leads with essential information (name, email, phone, company)
View all your leads in an organized table
Edit lead details anytime
Delete leads you no longer need

3. Status Tracking

Track each lead through 5 stages:

New - Just received this lead
Contacted - Made first contact
Qualified - Confirmed they're a good fit
Won - Successfully closed the deal
Lost - Deal didn't work out


Change status with a simple dropdown
Visual color-coding for quick status recognition

4. Smart Filtering

Filter leads by status with one click
See counts for each status category
Quickly find leads that need attention

5. Dashboard Overview

At-a-glance statistics:

Total leads in your pipeline
New leads to follow up on
Deals won this month
Deals lost this month



Technical Stack

Frontend: Next.js 14, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
Backend: FastAPI (Python)
Database: PostgreSQL
Authentication: JWT tokens

What LocalLead Mini Does NOT Include (Coming in Phase 2)

No automated follow-up reminders
No WhatsApp/SMS integration
No team features or lead assignment
No advanced reporting or analytics
No CSV import/export
No email notifications

Why LocalLead Mini?
Simple, focused, and gets the job done. No bloated features you'll never use. Just the essentials to keep your leads organized and moving through your sales pipeline.

